 dict(name="press",ar="1:1",res="2K",q="high",p="A heavy industrial stamping press of a grading room seen perfectly straight on, orthographic, in black cast iron and antique brass with rivets: two thick vertical columns at the left and right, a massive crossbeam on top with a large brass wheel, and in the middle a heavy rectangular press head lowered on a short steel ram; under the head an empty brass platen, a flat tray as wide as a playing card lying on its long side. Hot gold work light under the crossbeam. The press spans from 6% to 94% of the width and from 4% to 96% of the height. The platen and the area between the columns are empty."+MG),
 dict(name="belt",ar="16:9",res="1K",q="medium",p="A long straight factory conveyor belt seen perfectly from the side at eye level, orthographic, running across the full image width edge to edge: a black ribbed rubber belt on top, under it a row of identical polished antique-brass rollers evenly spaced, held in a black riveted steel side rail, warm gold light from above. The belt assembly occupies only the band from 40% to 60% of the image height and must tile seamlessly left to right. Nothing on the belt."+MG),
 dict(name="ticker",ar="1:1",res="2K",q="high",p="An antique stock ticker machine seen perfectly straight on, orthographic: a polished antique-brass mechanism with gears and a small printing wheel under a tall clear glass bell dome, on a round black lacquer wooden base with a brass rim. A narrow strip of cream paper tape comes out of the mechanism and falls straight down out of the bottom centre of the base, blank. Warm gold light inside the dome. The machine spans from 15% to 85% of the image width and from 3% to 90% of the height."+MG),
